            "text": "{\n  \"proposals\": [\n    {\n      \"rationale\": \"Incorporate the governing criteria for plans described in clause (ii) directly into the scope and summary of C0001 to provide a self-contained default reading.\",\n      \"operation\": \"edit\",\n      \"target\": \"C0001\",\n      \"qualifies\": [],\n      \"quote\": \"In the case of a single-employer plan described in clause (ii), the plan sponsor may elect to maintain a funding standard carryover balance, until such balance is reduced to zero.\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"concepts\": [],\n        \"claimants\": [],\n        \"typed_values\": [],\n        \"effective_periods\": [],\n        \"defined_terms\": [],\n        \"term_refs\": [],\n        \"kind\": \"permission\",\n        \"scope_quotes\": [\n          \"In the case of a single-employer plan described in clause (ii),\",\n          \"A plan is described in this clause if the plan—\\n\\n(I) was in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007, and\\n\\n(II) had a positive balance in the funding standard account under section 1082(b) of this title as in effect for such plan year and determined as of the end of such plan year.\"\n        ],\n        \"scope_text\": \"In the case of a single-employer plan that was in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007 and had a positive balance in the funding standard account under section 1082(b) of this title as in effect for such plan year and determined as of the end of such plan year\",\n        \"context_quotes\": [],\n        \"modality_quote\": \"may\",\n        \"modality\": \"may\",\n        \"alternative_quotes\": [],\n        \"choice_quote\": \"\",\n        \"choice_text\": \"\",\n        \"logic_text\": \"was in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007, and had a positive balance in the funding standard account under section 1082(b) of this title as in effect for such plan year and determined as of the end of such plan year\",\n        \"actor_quote\": \"the plan sponsor\",\n        \"actor\": \"the plan sponsor\",\n        \"action_quote\": \"elect to maintain a funding standard carryover balance, until such balance is reduced to zero\",\n        \"action\": \"elect to maintain a funding standard carryover balance, until such balance is reduced to zero\",\n        \"object_quote\": \"a funding standard carryover balance\",\n        \"object\": \"funding standard carryover balance\",\n        \"jurisdiction_quote\": \"\",\n        \"jurisdiction\": \"\",\n        \"relation\": \"none\",\n        \"references\": [\n          \"clause (ii)\",\n          \"section 1082(b)\"\n        ],\n        \"summary\": \"In the case of a single-employer plan that was in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007 and had a positive balance in the funding standard account under section 1082(b) of this title as in effect for such plan year and determined as of the end of such plan year, the plan sponsor may elect to maintain a funding standard carryover balance, until such balance is reduced to zero.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"observations\": []\n}",
